{# The callback section, shared by every engine template that feeds the #}
{# callback findings. Parameterized by (findings list, heading text, scan #}
{# coverage record) so each template passes its own heading text and the #}
{# coverage the producing scan stamped. The body is verbatim-pinned by the #}
{# section suite in src/lib.rs — wording or formatting drift fails CI. #}
{# The coverage record (issue #350) arrives as CoverageInfo strings: the #}
{# scan's status word and its admission line. The include appends exactly #}
{# one "Coverage:" qualification line — beside the entries, or as the whole #}
{# section beside the heading when the scan stamped no findings but admits #}
{# falling short — whenever the record carries an admission; a complete or #}
{# missing record renders exactly what it rendered before, and the line #}
{# names only bodies the scan never reached, never a body the scan read #}
{# and left unflagged. #}
{# The seam capability records (#357 fan-out): one admission line per #}
{# family this section feeds — the engine facets behind it, as the capability #}
{# probe answers them — quoted from the held seam report. Each rides exactly #}
{# one "Analysis engine:" line, after the coverage line, beside the entries; #}
{# when the section filed nothing at all the line rides under the heading, #}
{# the heading opening for the first line that needs it. An answerable or #}
{# undeclared family renders exactly what it rendered before. #}
{% macro callbacks_section(findings, heading, coverage, decompilation_cap) %}
{% if !findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

The following callback and function-pointer patterns were recognized in this
function by static analysis. Where a finding is credible, express the callback
boundary with the suggested Rust pattern instead of transliterating the raw
table indexing or registration call:

{% for finding in findings %}
- **{{ finding.suggestion|safe }}** ({{ finding.kind }} pattern, confidence {{ finding.confidence }})
  Evidence: `{{ finding.evidence|safe }}`
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% if !coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
Coverage: {{ coverage.admission }}

{% endif %}
{% if !decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ decompilation_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
